#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166785 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166623 :question/id #uuid "94ad0100-80d0-5fd5-9cda-039d9a8bcc47" :question/math-academy-id "e-8406" :question/problem "Calculate the integral\n$\\displaystyle \\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits} \\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits} \\displaystyle \\int \\csch(3x+1)\\coth(3x+1) \\, \\textrm{d}x$." :question/worked-solution "Let\n\n$$\nu=3x+1\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm d u}{\\textrm d x} = 3\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad \\textrm{d}x =\\dfrac{1}{3} \\, \\textrm{d}u\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and compute it, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\intcsch (3x + 1)\\coth (3x + 1)dx &= \\intcsch u\\coth u \\cdot \\frac{1}{3}du \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{3}\\intcsch u\\coth udu \\\\\n&= \\frac{1}{3}(-csch u) + C \\\\\n&=-\\frac{1}{3}csch (3x + 1) + C\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e112da03-ea8d-5997-a7be-4f5be5e365e2" :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167382 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "88d779eb-3059-5e10-9ffa-9c57cdb560ac" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}\\tanh^{2} (\\frac{2x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165501} {:answer/id #uuid "af0307f2-86d7-5c17-a1fa-8bb3fea513ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2}csch^{2} (\\frac{2x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165502} {:answer/id #uuid "d9938ee9-360b-5a1f-aa60-ef8f58c83bb3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{5}\\tanh (\\frac{2x}{5})sech (\\frac{2x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165503} {:answer/id #uuid "227afb1e-6eca-5bb2-a3d1-ef8393dd4fe9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}\\tanh (\\frac{2x}{5}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165504} {:answer/id #uuid "748b12b0-adef-55ab-b72c-4e206023529f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5\\tanh (\\frac{5x}{2}) + C" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165505}] :answer-field/id #uuid "c876c1e5-5c64-5eb8-9427-add64a01cbf2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165500}] :question/id #uuid "cf5a74bd-f5d8-5f29-8b73-d0a5a5b3d563" :question/math-academy-id "q-95534" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\intsech^{2} (\\frac{2x}{5})dx$."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186167383 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a2e66c41-42b0-5332-a7d0-b6c5dc464adf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}(sech 5 - sech 2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165507} {:answer/id #uuid "ac2e0934-8c3c-58c1-8fe2-46fe8b538607" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5(sech 2 - sech 5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165508} {:answer/id #uuid "bd2729bd-5220-53e9-8077-116776585853" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}(\\tanh 2 - \\tanh 5)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165509} {:answer/id #uuid "f8a812f9-022b-585a-b9b4-483dd8f5384c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}(\\tanh^{2} 10)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165510} {:answer/id #uuid "2b4beb1f-07e1-564a-8fcc-8cd42fa4f82a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}(sech 5 - sech 10)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165511}] :answer-field/id #uuid "a9009d1f-5ab7-5091-a657-15a5fbcf8762" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186165506}] :question/id #uuid "654e8f